From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Keep affiliate cart pricing and quote requests off the publish switch.

The shopping cart and a quote request must stay available for affiliates.
Publish tab switches must not close them.

orders.priceLines is the price read the quote page uses after the cart
continues to checkout. orders.createRequest saves that quote. Both called
guardAffiliateFeature with feature "quote", so an unpublished quote row
rejected the cart checkout with "This feature is not published for affiliates."

Remove those two calls. Leave every other feature guard in place.
listAffiliateFeaturePublish and setAffiliateFeaturePublish stay admin-only,
so the Publish tab is unchanged.

No SQL. Nothing in this patch deletes a row or sends an order.

Apply from the cabinet-backend repository root:

    git apply --check /path/to/cabinet-backend-quote-cart-always-open.patch
    git apply /path/to/cabinet-backend-quote-cart-always-open.patch

Cloud agents cannot push 7809tom-sys/cabinet-backend (403). Apply this file
there and deploy it before affiliate checkout depends on the new behavior.

---
diff --git a/server/routers/orders.ts b/server/routers/orders.ts
--- a/server/routers/orders.ts
+++ b/server/routers/orders.ts
@@ -5,7 +5,6 @@
